{
 "id": "stormbitten_wyvern",
 "name": "Stormbitten Wyvern",
 "role": "Splinterborn boss \u00b7 Ring 3 Stormfront, Stormfront Siege Apex \u00b7 flyer \u00b7 Lightning, Line AoE (storm breath), Void Pull (wing gust)",
 "hitbox_blocks": [
  8.0,
  3.0,
  5.0
 ],
 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at feet centre, shown perched with wings half spread. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 8 x 3 x 5 blocks (wingspan x height x length); horns, snout and tail reach past it.",
  "A two-legged wyvern with weathered copper-green scales (bare copper showing where the patina wore off), copper-gold belly plates, torn wing membranes, copper lightning-rod horns that spark, and the splinter glowing in its throat.",
  "Bones (23): root > body > neck > neck2 > head > jaw, horns; neck2 > splinter; body > wing_l > wing_l_outer > wing_l_tip (same on the right); body > leg_l > shin_l > foot_l (same on the right); body > tail > tail2 > tail3. Paint the membrane holes as transparent pixels.",
  "Animations: spawn (dives out of the storm clouds and lands), idle (perched, wings half folded, horns spark), walk, run, fly, glide, attack (bite and tail-blade swipe), hurt, death (falls, wings crumple, the splinter drops from the throat), ability_lightning (rears up, horns flash), ability_line_aoe (storm breath in a straight line from the throat), ability_void_pull (huge wing beat that blows players toward the edge)."
 ],
